<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6034] Query using the `DENSE_RANK()` function hits the model execution, but the smart recommendation does not recommend an index</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6034</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;After model construction, execute the first query. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Click on the homepage recommendation: No index is recommended. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Execute the query with the `DENSE_RANK()` function again. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Recommend again: Index recommendation succeeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
